{"id":"659776","name":"豆沙南瓜饼","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/659776/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"南瓜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"红豆沙","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"南瓜去皮去籽洗净切片。","img":"images/659776/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"南瓜放入碗中上锅蒸熟。","img":"images/659776/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒸好的南瓜破壁机打成糊。","img":"images/659776/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"糯米粉倒入盆中。","img":"images/659776/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入南瓜糊，边揉边酌情加入少量清水。","img":"images/659776/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将糯米粉揉成面团。","img":"images/659776/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"红豆沙备用。","img":"images/659776/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"取一小块面团揉圆。","img":"images/659776/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"捏成碗状后加入红豆沙，收口搓圆。","img":"images/659776/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"均匀的裹上白芝麻。","img":"images/659776/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"按压成饼状。","img":"images/659776/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"将所有面团一个个做成饼状。","img":"images/659776/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"锅中热油放入南瓜饼。","img":"images/659776/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"小火慢煎，中途勤翻面，将南瓜饼煎熟为止即可。","img":"images/659776/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659776/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659776/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659776/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}